   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">SCS7 # of CSOs that have enhanced representation of constituencies on annual basis</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">This indicator connects to our desired result of a gender responsive civil society where GYW are represented in active membership and/or leadership (civil society domain). Focus of this indicator is on unique CSOs. If a CSO has enhanced representation of constituencies in year 1 and also in year 2, this CSO will only be included in the quantitative actual of year one. So if you included a CSO in your actuals for 2021, it cannot be included for your actuals of 2022.</narrative>
   </description>
